{"type":"standard","title":"Sarah Trone Garriott","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sarah Trone Garriott</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q106762645","titles":{"canonical":"Sarah_Trone_Garriott","normalized":"Sarah Trone Garriott","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sarah Trone Garriott</span></span>"},"pageid":67606542,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Sarah_Trone_Garriott_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg/330px-Sarah_Trone_Garriott_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":410},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Sarah_Trone_Garriott_2023_%28cropped_2%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1367,"height":1698},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377950078","tid":"29c6ae78-be0b-11f1-8c93-559103f5d2dd","timestamp":"2026-10-02T02:44:18Z","description":"Iowa politician","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Trone_Garriott","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Trone_Garriott?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Trone_Garriott?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sarah_Trone_Garriott"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Trone_Garriott","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Sarah_Trone_Garriott","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarah_Trone_Garriott?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Sarah_Trone_Garriott"}},"extract":"Sarah Trone Garriott is an American politician and minister serving as a member of the Iowa Senate from the 14th district since 2021. A member of the Democratic Party, she represents part of Dallas County in the Des Moines area and served previously as Senate minority whip. She is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 election in Iowa's 3rd congressional district.","extract_html":"<p><b>Sarah Trone Garriott</b> is an American politician and minister serving as a member of the Iowa Senate from the 14th district since 2021. A member of the Democratic Party, she represents part of Dallas County in the Des Moines area and served previously as Senate minority whip. She is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 election in Iowa's 3rd congressional district.</p>"}